{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The nakedness of your sister.</b> Not through marriage." "<b>Your father's daughter.</b> For example, if your father forced or seduced a woman who is not your mother and she bore him a daughter — that is <b>born of the house</b>. Or if a foreign man forced or seduced your mother and she bore him a daughter — that is born outside."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:10.697226980Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}